Third-party components
----------------------

Bundled into the APK:

- AndroidX / Jetpack Compose / Material 3 (Apache-2.0) — native UI toolkit.
- Kotlin standard library (Apache-2.0).
- React, React DOM, zustand, clsx, fflate, KaTeX, Mermaid, Prism,
  mdast-util-*, micromark-* (MIT) — web chat client.
- idb (ISC) — IndexedDB wrapper.
- jsQR (Apache-2.0) — QR decoding for the top-up scan assist.
- Simple Icons DeepSeek glyph (CC0-1.0) — brand mark in the web client.

Used at build time only (not shipped in the APK):

- TypeScript (Apache-2.0), Rspack (MIT), SWC helpers (Apache-2.0),
  oxlint (MIT), Gradle and the Android Gradle Plugin (Apache-2.0).

Material Symbols (Apache-2.0) is the outline icon set used in the native UI.

